m (404 on /apps/<id>/... usually means a wrong appId or unpublished app.) Tj 0.420 0.390 1.000 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 204.0 Tm (3. Reports API - POST /api/feedback) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 164.0 Tm (Send user reports \(errors, suggestions, feature requests, ratings\).) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 140.0 Tm (Required: appId, type, title \(3-160 chars\), description \(5-5000\).) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 121.0 Tm (type is one of: bug_report | suggestion | feature_request | rating) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 102.0 Tm (Optional: link \(problem URL, max 2000\), contactEmail, rating 1-5,) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 83.0 Tm (screenshot \(base64/text, max about 1.5MB\).) Tj ET
