copy offline, refresh when online.) Tj 0.420 0.390 1.000 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 353.0 Tm (5. Endpoint reference) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 314.5 Tm (GET  /api/apps  -  List published apps.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 297.5 Tm (GET  /api/apps/[id]  -  Get one published app by id or slug.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 280.5 Tm (GET  /api/apps/[id]/plans  -  List active plans for an app.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 263.5 Tm (GET  /api/apps/popular  -  List most popular apps.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 246.5 Tm (GET  /api/apps/new-releases  -  List latest new releases.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 229.5 Tm (GET  /api/public/apps  -  Public app directory \(no auth\).) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 212.5 Tm (GET  /api/apps/[id]/tutorial  -  Get tutorial for an app.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 195.5 Tm (GET  /api/apps/[id]/features  -  Get the app master feature list.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 178.5 Tm (POST  /api/apps/[id]/features  -  Replace the app master feature list \(desktop sync\).) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 161.5 Tm (POST  /api/apps/[id]/ping  -  Desktop heartbeat - marks the app API-connected.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 144.5 Tm (GET  /api/payment/methods  -  List active payment methods \(filtered HEALTHY\).) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 127.5 Tm (POST  /api/payment/request  -  Create a pending payment request.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 110.5 Tm (GET  /api/payment/status/[id]  -  Read the authenticated payment status.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 93.5 Tm (GET  /api/payment/history  -  List authenticated payment history.) Tj 0.090 0.090 0.180 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 64 76.5 Tm (GET  /api/user/profile  -  Read the authenticated user profile.) Tj ET
